pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: `Cardinality::add` falls back to a general PB constraint when a summand
% coefficient exceeds 2, and that fallback subtracted the merge cancellation from the
% degree in i64 after checking only the unadjusted sum. The degree sum is i64::MIN + 2 and
% the three merges cancel 3, so the true degree is i64::MIN - 1. The formula is satisfiable
% (all three variables true).
f 2 ;
pol 1 2 + ;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : 3 ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
